  "detail_text": "Amendment 1: The purpose of this amendment is to update the registration link within the attachment. The United States Army Aviation Center of Excellence invites you to the Portfolio Acquisition Executive (PAE) Maneuver – Air Industry Days, “ Delivering Capability Today ” 24-26 August 2026 at Fort Rucker, AL to facilitate interaction between Aviation Industry personnel and Senior Military Leaders; communicate our modernization strategy and promote collaboration; allow Industry representatives the opportunity to display current capabilities.",
